  "result": "{\"drafts\": [{\"draft_id\": \"15\", \"subject\": \"Written payment plan terms and itemized statement - statement 677801\", \"from_addr\": \"finance.owner@example.com\", \"to_addr\": \"financialservices@saguarovalleymed.example\", \"cc_addr\": \"\", \"bcc_addr\": \"\", \"body_text\": \"Hello,\\n\\nPlease send the written terms of the interest-free payment plan and a current itemized statement for statement 677801.\\n\\nMy records show a $2,630.00 patient balance, a pending installment of $634.00, a recurring $275.00 debit, and offers described as both 6 months and 24 months of $326.17. I need one reconciled written schedule before the next debits on 2026-06-25 and 2026-06-27 so I do not overpay or double-pay.\\n\\nPlease confirm the total balance, the number and amount of installments, the first payment date, and whether any payments already scheduled will be credited.\\n\\nThank you,\\nElena Rivera\", \"body_html\": null, \"in_reply_to\": null, \"created_at\": \"2026-06-15T01:00:00Z\", \"updated_at\": \"2026-06-15T01:00:00Z\"}, {\"draft_id\": \"14\", \"subject\": \"Account ledger and hold request - claim 2026982460\", \"from_addr\": \"finance.owner@example.com\", \"to_addr\": \"billing@desertskyanesthesia.example\", \"cc_addr\": \"\", \"bcc_addr\": \"\", \"body_text\": \"Hello,\\n\\nPlease place the account on hold for 60 days and send a complete itemized ledger for all charges and payments on my account, including dates, CPT codes, claim numbers, and the payer's allowed amount.\\n\\nYour notices have shown different balances ($1,284.00 and $2,140.00), and my records show prior payments totaling $2,695.43. I am not paying the balance-billed amount while the plan review under claim 2026982460 is open.\\n\\nPlease confirm the current balance in writing and apply the hold.\\n\\nThank you,\\nElena Rivera\", \"body_html\": null, \"in_reply_to\": null, \"created_at\": \"2026-06-15T01:00:00Z\", \"updated_at\": \"2026-06-15T01:00:00Z\"}, {\"draft_id\": \"13\", \"subject\": \"Distribution 70294 - substantiation packet ($628.00)\", \"from_addr\": \"finance.owner@example.com\", \"to_addr\": \"compliance@copperstatehsa.example\", \"cc_addr\": \"\", \"bcc_addr\": \"\", \"body_text\": \"Hello,\\n\\nI am providing substantiation for distribution 70294 ($628.00). The packet includes the itemized provider statement (statement 589256) and the matching explanation of benefits showing the patient responsibility.\\n\\nPlease confirm receipt and whether you need the documents uploaded through the member portal or sent as attachments. I want to make sure the file is complete before the 2026-06-24 deadline.\\n\\nThank you,\\nElena Rivera\", \"body_html\": null, \"in_reply_to\": null, \"created_at\": \"2026-06-15T01:00:00Z\", \"updated_at\": \"2026-06-15T01:00:00Z\"}, {\"draft_id\": \"6\", \"subject\": \"Re: Claim reprocessed - refund of the overpayment\", \"from_addr\": \"finance.owner@example.com\", \"to_addr\": \"patientaccounts@rinconimaging.example\", \"cc_addr\": \"\", \"bcc_addr\": \"\", \"body_text\": \"Since the claim reprocessed at the in-network rate, the amount I paid exceeds the corrected responsibility. Please issue the refund and send a corrected statement.\", \"body_html\": null, \"in_reply_to\": null, \"created_at\": \"2026-06-05T13:18:00Z\", \"updated_at\": \"2026-06-14T20:27:00Z\"}, {\"draft_id\": \"7\", \"subject\": \"Not proceeding - debt settlement solicitation\", \"from_addr\": \"finance.owner@example.com\", \"to_addr\": \"intake@debtreliefpartners.example\", \"cc_addr\": \"\", \"bcc_addr\": \"\", \"body_text\": \"Remove me from this campaign. The hospital offers an interest-free plan, and letting accounts go unpaid during negotiation is not something I will do.\", \"body_html\": null, \"in_reply_to\": null, \"created_at\": \"2026-06-07T12:01:00Z\", \"updated_at\": \"2026-06-14T19:55:00Z\"}, {\"draft_id\": \"5\", \"subject\": \"HSA contribution room - confirm remaining before I add anything\", \"from_addr\": \"fina