nce.owner@example.com\", \"to_addr\": \"memberservices@copperstatehsa.example\", \"cc_addr\": \"\", \"bcc_addr\": \"\", \"body_text\": \"Please confirm my contributions to date including the employer portion, and the remaining room for my coverage tier. I do not want to exceed the annual limit.\", \"body_html\": null, \"in_reply_to\": null, \"created_at\": \"2026-05-26T07:48:00Z\", \"updated_at\": \"2026-06-14T18:28:00Z\"}, {\"draft_id\": \"4\", \"subject\": \"Re: Substantiation request - receipt attached\", \"from_addr\": \"finance.owner@example.com\", \"to_addr\": \"compliance@copperstatehsa.example\", \"cc_addr\": \"\", \"bcc_addr\": \"\", \"body_text\": \"Attaching the itemized receipt and the matching EOB for the distribution in question. Confirm once the account is substantiated so it is not reported as taxable.\", \"body_html\": null, \"in_reply_to\": null, \"created_at\": \"2026-06-03T09:00:00Z\", \"updated_at\": \"2026-06-13T17:55:00Z\"}, {\"draft_id\": \"9\", \"subject\": \"Card payoff sequencing note\", \"from_addr\": \"finance.owner@example.com\", \"to_addr\": \"finance.owner@example.com\", \"cc_addr\": \"\", \"bcc_addr\": \"\", \"body_text\": \"Notes to self: the medical balance on the card accrues at the purchase APR while the hospital plan is interest-free. Pay the card down first; keep the reserve untouched.\", \"body_html\": null, \"in_reply_to\": null, \"created_at\": \"2026-06-03T08:54:00Z\", \"updated_at\": \"2026-06-13T16:07:00Z\"}, {\"draft_id\": \"8\", \"subject\": \"Benefits: confirm HDHP tier for the rest of the plan year\", \"from_addr\": \"finance.owner@example.com\", \"to_addr\": \"hr@pima.example.edu\", \"cc_addr\": \"\", \"bcc_addr\": \"\", \"body_text\": \"Can you confirm my HDHP coverage tier on file? My contribution limit depends on it, and I want to avoid a prorated-limit surprise if anything changed mid-year.\", \"body_html\": null, \"in_reply_to\": null, \"created_at\": \"2026-05-31T21:04:00Z\", \"updated_at\": \"2026-06-13T13:50:00Z\"}, {\"draft_id\": \"2\", \"subject\": \"Re: Statement - itemized detail request\", \"from_addr\": \"finance.owner@example.com\", \"to_addr\": \"billing@saguarovalleymed.example\", \"cc_addr\": \"\", \"bcc_addr\": \"\", \"body_text\": \"Before I enroll in a payment plan I need the itemized statement with CPT codes and the allowed amounts so I can match it against the EOB. Please also send the financial assistance screening form.\", \"body_html\": null, \"in_reply_to\": null, \"created_at\": \"2026-06-03T19:26:00Z\", \"updated_at\": \"2026-06-13T13:16:00Z\"}, {\"draft_id\": \"3\", \"subject\": \"Re: Payment plan - confirming terms in writing\", \"from_addr\": \"finance.owner@example.com\", \"to_addr\": \"financialservices@saguarovalleymed.example\", \"cc_addr\": \"\", \"bcc_addr\": \"\", \"body_text\": \"Confirming: 12 monthly installments, no interest, no credit check, and no impact to collections status while payments are current. Please confirm the first due date.\", \"body_html\": null, \"in_reply_to\": null, \"created_at\": \"2026-06-11T08:26:00Z\", \"updated_at\": \"2026-06-13T08:01:00Z\"}, {\"draft_id\": \"11\", \"subject\": \"Re: Physical therapy authorization\", \"from_addr\": \"finance.owner@example.com\", \"to_addr\": \"front@oldpueblopt.example\", \"cc_addr\": \"\", \"bcc_addr\": \"\", \"body_text\": \"Confirming the authorized visit count and the copay per visit so I can budget the remaining sessions.\", \"body_html\": null, \"in_reply_to\": null, \"created_at\": \"2026-05-30T06:49:00Z\", \"updated_at\": \"2026-06-13T06:51:00Z\"}, {\"draft_id\": \"12\", \"subject\": \"Re: Lease renewal - decision timeline\", \"from_addr\": \"finance.owner@example.com\", \"to_addr\": \"office@cactuswrenapts.example\", \"cc_addr\": \"\", \"bcc_addr\": \"\", \"body_text\": \"I need the renewal terms in writing before I commit. Medical bills are being reprocessed and I want the July cash flow settled first.\", \"body_html\": null, \"in_reply_to\": null, \"created_at\": \"2026-06-06T08:27:00Z\", \"updated_at\": \"2026-06-12T18:12:00Z\"}, {\"draft_id\": \"10\", \"subject\": \"Re: Prescription - 90-day supply pricing\", \"from_addr\": \"finance.owner@example.com\", \"to_addr\": \"rx@tanqueverderx.example\", \"cc_addr\": \"\", \"bcc_addr\": \"\", \"body_text\": \"What is the 90-day supply price versus three 30-day fills, and does the generic change the copay tier?\", \"body_html\": null, \"in_reply_to\": null, \"created_at\": \"2026-06-11T14:49:00Z\", \"updated_at\": \"2026-06-12T13:40:00Z\"}, {\"draft_id\": \"1\", \"subject\": \"Re: Balance billing notice - hold the account pending review\", \"from_addr\": \"finance.owner@example.com\", \"to_addr\": \"billing@desertskyanesthesia.example\", \"cc_addr\": \"\", \"bcc_addr\": \"\", \"body_text\": \"The plan is reviewing the assistant-surgeon charge under the surprise-billing rules. Please place the account on hold and send the claim reference you have on file. I am not paying the balance-billed amount while that review is open.\", \"body_html\": null, \"in_reply_to\": null, \"created_at\": \"2026-05-29T14:23:00Z\", \"updated_at\": \"2026-06-12T09:00:00Z\"}], \"total_drafts\": 15, \"current_page\": 1, \"total_pages\": 1, \"page_size\": 20}"
}

